# SCENARIO: fix_123_pvp_ignore_proportionate   SEED: 0   CAMERAS: none   BOTCFG: auto
# Fix #123 - PvP proportionality. NORMAL AI (no debug mode). Same shape as baseline B9: the non-GM
# level-8 harness character pokes 10 different visible bots at a Thais street crossing (attack 8 s,
# stop). Every bot >= level 16 takes the OUTLEVEL branch: 17% fight / 83% ignore (spec unchanged),
# and an ignore hits back once with 50% chance -- now via ignoreHitBack, scaled and never lethal.
# Run: runner.py fix_123_pvp_ignore_proportionate.steps   (needs botcfg: botGangMinVictimLevel>8)
# Baseline (2026-11-18, bl_b9r): 3 of the 6 harness deaths were "ignore" hit-backs (one real attack
# spell from a high-level bot); void run bl_b9: "[GANG] formed RAID size=5 victim='Harness One'".
# Acceptance (server truth):
#   - >= 1 "[PVP_IGNORE_HITBACK]" line (P(0 in 10 pokes) ~ 0.5%: 0.83 ignore x 0.5 hit-back);
#   - every one leaves the attacker alive: none matches "hp=N->0" or a negative result;
#   - zero "[GANG] formed RAID" with the harness character as victim (level 8 < 50 floor);
#   - deaths from the 17% "fight" branch are still possible and are NOT asserted (spec).
# Retaliation shares stay UNDERPOWERED at N=10 and are read from audit `state` (watch *) only.
@srv audit kinds state,cmd,census
@srv audit watch *
@srv audit on expect="enabled=on"
@srv audit mark "F123 start"
@p1 login
@p1 goto 32369,32215,7 range=3 stuck=15 timeout=120
@p1 login optional=1
@p1 goto 32369,32215,7 range=4 stuck=15 timeout=90 optional=1
@p1 wait-see any-bot timeout=60 as=V1 optional=1
@srv audit mark "F123 poke 1 $V1"
@p1 attack $V1 optional=1
@p1 hold 8 optional=1
@p1 attack stop optional=1
@p1 hold 4 optional=1
@p1 login optional=1
@p1 goto 32369,32215,7 range=4 stuck=15 timeout=90 optional=1
@p1 wait-see any-bot timeout=60 not=$V1 as=V2 optional=1
@srv audit mark "F123 poke 2 $V2"
@p1 attack $V2 optional=1
@p1 hold 8 optional=1
@p1 attack stop optional=1
@p1 hold 4 optional=1
@p1 login optional=1
@p1 goto 32369,32215,7 range=4 stuck=15 timeout=90 optional=1
@p1 wait-see any-bot timeout=60 not=$V1,$V2 as=V3 optional=1
@srv audit mark "F123 poke 3 $V3"
@p1 attack $V3 optional=1
@p1 hold 8 optional=1
@p1 attack stop optional=1
@p1 hold 4 optional=1
@p1 login optional=1
@p1 goto 32369,32215,7 range=4 stuck=15 timeout=90 optional=1
@p1 wait-see any-bot timeout=60 not=$V1,$V2,$V3 as=V4 optional=1
@srv audit mark "F123 poke 4 $V4"
@p1 attack $V4 optional=1
@p1 hold 8 optional=1
@p1 attack stop optional=1
@p1 hold 4 optional=1
@p1 login optional=1
@p1 goto 32369,32215,7 range=4 stuck=15 timeout=90 optional=1
@p1 wait-see any-bot timeout=60 not=$V1,$V2,$V3,$V4 as=V5 optional=1
@srv audit mark "F123 poke 5 $V5"
@p1 attack $V5 optional=1
@p1 hold 8 optional=1
@p1 attack stop optional=1
@p1 hold 4 optional=1
@p1 login optional=1
@p1 goto 32369,32215,7 range=4 stuck=15 timeout=90 optional=1
@p1 wait-see any-bot timeout=60 not=$V1,$V2,$V3,$V4,$V5 as=V6 optional=1
@srv audit mark "F123 poke 6 $V6"
@p1 attack $V6 optional=1
@p1 hold 8 optional=1
@p1 attack stop optional=1
@p1 hold 4 optional=1
@p1 login optional=1
@p1 goto 32369,32215,7 range=4 stuck=15 timeout=90 optional=1
@p1 wait-see any-bot timeout=60 not=$V1,$V2,$V3,$V4,$V5,$V6 as=V7 optional=1
@srv audit mark "F123 poke 7 $V7"
@p1 attack $V7 optional=1
@p1 hold 8 optional=1
@p1 attack stop optional=1
@p1 hold 4 optional=1
@p1 login optional=1
@p1 goto 32369,32215,7 range=4 stuck=15 timeout=90 optional=1
@p1 wait-see any-bot timeout=60 not=$V1,$V2,$V3,$V4,$V5,$V6,$V7 as=V8 optional=1
@srv audit mark "F123 poke 8 $V8"
@p1 attack $V8 optional=1
@p1 hold 8 optional=1
@p1 attack stop optional=1
@p1 hold 4 optional=1
@p1 login optional=1
@p1 goto 32369,32215,7 range=4 stuck=15 timeout=90 optional=1
@p1 wait-see any-bot timeout=60 not=$V1,$V2,$V3,$V4,$V5,$V6,$V7,$V8 as=V9 optional=1
@srv audit mark "F123 poke 9 $V9"
